\n1日でも早い復興をお祈りしています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"    ーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おはようございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日、AKB総選挙が行われましたね。\n須田亜香里さんが、第2位でとても嬉しかったです!\nアイドルの中のアイドル･･･✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"須田亜香里さんや荻野由佳さんを見ると、とてもキラキラしていて、やっぱりアイドルって素敵だなといつも思わせてくれます!\n笑顔が素敵な人私もなりたい🙂"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、総選挙のスピーチを聞くと、すごく感情移入してしまいます😭"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とくに、第2回総選挙のときの、佐藤亜美菜さんのスピーチが好きです。\nファンの皆さんの掛け声をきっかけに話の流れが変わるスピーチです!\nこのスピーチを見ると、ファンの方ってとても大切だなと、思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も前向きに生きよう🚶"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バナナーコ(みんな覚えてるかな?)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYM5J3GQBKAP815F3SCVR5D","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⊿長沢菜々香"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-4974":{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/24/6455280/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こないだ家族と、河中湖オルゴールの森美術館に\n行ってきましたぁぁぁあヽ( ^o^ )ノ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/24/6455280/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お～しろっ  お～しろっ(*^ω^*) ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/24/6455280/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ﾜ━ヾ( o･∀)ﾉﾞヾ(o･∀･o)ﾉﾞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中世ヨーロッパの\n王侯貴族になった気分っ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美術館 大好きっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンティークオルゴールやパイプオルガンなどの\n自動演奏楽器の世界観に魅了されて、\n大好きになっちゃいました  )^o^(素敵です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"音楽とか、お花とか、アンティークとか、\nわたしの大好きなものが沢山あって\n幸せでした～( ´ ▽ ` )ﾉ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/24/6455280/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"周りも、森に囲まれていて\n富士山も綺麗でしたし、\nまさに 森が好きなわたしにとって\n堪らない場所でした！(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あー堪らないっ！\n森に住みたいっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつかギンガの森に住んで、\n白馬に乗ったギンガマンさまが現れぇぇぇぇえぉうぃえ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"花びらのツメェっっっ！キリッ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/24/6455280/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、お休みなさゆませ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/24/6455280/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/24/6455280/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/24/6455280/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃんヽ(｡･ω･｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/24/6455280/0008.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-7932":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂の姉。岩瀬佑美子。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/20/0282274/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は 姉さんが大好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までも、これからも。ずっと。ずっと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"姉さんは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誰よりもメンバー想いだったよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『悲しいよゆみ姉..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"苦しいんだゆみ姉..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悔しいよぉ！ゆみ姉。』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう やってメンバーが泣いて迷って頼った時、姉さんは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『悲しいよなぁ。』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『苦しかったんだよね』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『私も悔しいよ。』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こう言ってまるで自分の事のように。一緒に泣きながら強く強く抱きしめてくれたね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『大丈夫だ。』って。頷いて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"手も小さくて。背も小さくて。足も小さい。姉さん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けど、姉さんは誰よりも誰よりも大きな心をもっていたよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は姉さんに何度も助けられたよ。本当に...ありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感謝の気持ちでいっぱい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう...ありがとう...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うちらは笑いのツボが似ていて、いっつも二人して突っ込み合って笑ったね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"くっだらないことにも大笑いで。血管の話、あれ、きっと今までで一番笑ったかも。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思い出したら今でも笑えてくるよ。可笑しかったなぁ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうさ、姉さんとの思い出書いてたらキリないよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の涙にもキリがないよ.........。実は書きながらもろに号泣してる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのね、姉さん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私ね、ずっとずっと姉さんのこと尊敬してたのよ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すっごいなぁ、本当にさすがだなぁっていつも会うたびに思ってた。目で追ってた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"追いかけていたかったよ？本音はね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱりまだ寂しい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けど、悩んで迷って迷って考えに考えて姉さんが決めたことだって知ってるから。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は 背中を押すよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいばい？さようなら？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"違う。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いってらっしゃい!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おめでとうや!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"卒業は１つのことを終えて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次のステップに向かう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明るい日なんだ!!大切な時なんだ。頑張って!!って送る日なんだよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、姉さん??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も頑張るから本当に頑張るから、私が身体も心も大きくなった時にまた再会してやってください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何でもないあのやりとりが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今ではかけがえないもの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何年後かにまた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのかけがえのない"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何でもないやりとりをしようよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつか、その日まで...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"瀬をはやみ 岩にせかるる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"滝川の われても末に 逢わむとぞ思ふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当の意味は恋文だけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の気持ちはこの和歌に近いよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今まで ありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして これからもよろしくね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46のお姉さんは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"永久不滅よ。佑美姉さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いってらっしゃい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/20/0282274/0001.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}}